{"v":4,"catch":"Shieldwall 是一款帶有策略元素的有趣的第三人稱戰術戰鬥模擬器。","desc":"它讓你感覺自己就像戰場上的班長。\n凱撒需要你！高盧不會被自己征服。站在雄鷹之下，率領軍團，為了羅馬的榮耀！\n\n遊戲特色：\n- 作為單一角色玩時控制部隊編隊\n- 享受極其動態且充滿樂趣的戰鬥\n- 在一場比賽中圍攻敵人並保衛自己的城堡\n- 在 2-4 支球隊的比賽中製定自己的策略\n- 透過基於真實凱撒戰鬥的戰役，感受真正的羅馬","publisher":"Games Harbor","release":"2025-02-13","genres":["模擬","策略","動作","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","葡萄牙文","俄文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.1GB / Switch 1.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/18f6090d636d6a48abde9fc6d2560f449b0707eea93e9778bcf56d1ff7c3e575.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/058ed81ab990e4f9da05094e3db7cf0290c2ff373ec15d3e32f4cc1160dca231.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2c032745ceb61b4f8e0e35a37a3e9131c0f203c67a41fc46483f9e67a0663607.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd9d937b1d4256587f3c65613428f935753ac6d14525f1e55681a11f76ec0170.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/45f54ec7cfdfbf48c9898676ba992e33f2db6a1308d1f40ff5ba69b48f180384.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f16ea5e94260b102e72eaf88739db34a67c4186af61f70e487bd5bfae6d0edc.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ad301f81a000","dlc":[]}